# Winning the first Allied mission with the developers' Alt-W: the score
# screen, the hall of fame, the map on which the next mission is chosen, and
# that mission.
# args: -PLAYTEST
at 301 click 320 231
at 341 key RETURN
at 401 click 260 228
at 600 keydown ALT
at 601 key W
at 605 keyup ALT
at 1200 shot score_counting
at 2000 shot hall_of_fame
at 2001 type AB
at 2020 key RETURN
at 2400 shot map_selection
at 2401 click 360 240
at 3200 shot next_mission_start
at 4500 shot next_mission_under_way
at 4501 quit
